===============================================================================
Acknowledgements
===============================================================================

All DSP in this plugin is first-party code written for this project (see
src/VENDORED.md); there is no third-party code to relicense. The algorithms
were learned from, and are gratefully indebted to, prior art:

  - Reverb — a feedback-delay-network hall developed from a plate reverb after
    Jon Dattorro, "Effect Design, Part 1: Reverberator and Other Filters"
    (JAES, 1997).
  - Tape delay — inspired by the tape/BBD delays of Airwindows (Chris Johnson).
  - Chorus — modelled on the Roland Juno-series BBD stereo chorus.
  - Saturation — a tanh tape-style waveshaper.

These are acknowledgements only: no code from those projects is included.
